@startuml
'规则删除时同步清理预警配置流程

skinparam {
    DatabaseBackgroundColor lightgoldenrodyellow
    EntityBackgroundColor lightgoldenrodyellow
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFE6E6
}

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    LifeLineBackgroundColor khaki
    ParticipantBackgroundColor lightgoldenrodyellow
}

actor 运营人员 as Operator order 10
participant "M端" as Admin order 20
participant "Task 服务" as Task order 30
participant "规则 DB" as RuleDB order 40
participant "预警 DB" as AlertDB order 50

== 删除阶段（M端）==

Operator -> Admin: 删除库存规则
Admin -> RuleDB++: 执行规则删除
return

== 清理预警阶段（异步任务）==

RuleDB -> Task++: binlog 变更事件

alt 非 DELETE 操作
    note right of Task: 结束
else DELETE 操作
    Task -> AlertDB++: 删除相同 bizType+bizId+\nquotaType+bizDim 的预警配置
    return
end

return

@enduml
